    "on_off": {
      "type": "help-topic",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "on-off",
        "heading": "Switching on and off",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/v2-controls-full_visual.png",
        "content": "<p>To switch it on, press the play button. It glows blue when it’s ready. Place a book on the player and press play.</p><p>To switch it off, hold the play button for about 3 seconds, until the light goes off. Your place in the story is saved.</p><p>It also switches itself off. After a minute with nothing playing the play button pulses a dim blue, and a few minutes later the player switches off to save the battery.</p>",
        "note": "<p><strong>Player has an on/off switch on the back?</strong> Flip it down to switch on and up to switch off. Everything else on this page is for players without a switch.</p>"
      }
    },
    "controls": {
      "type": "help-topic",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "controls",
        "heading": "Play, pause and chapters",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/back-to-the-start-visual.png",
        "image_position": "start",
        "tinted": true,
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>Play or pause:</strong> press the play button.</li><li><strong>Next or previous chapter:</strong> press the right or left arrow.</li><li><strong>Fast forward or rewind:</strong> hold the right or left arrow.</li><li><strong>Back to the start of the book:</strong> hold the play button and press the left arrow, until you hear a tone.</li><li><strong>Swap books:</strong> lift the book off and place another. Each book remembers where you got to.</li></ul>"
      }
    },
    "sound": {
      "type": "help-topic",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "sound",
        "heading": "Volume and headphones",
        "content": "<p>Press + and − to change the volume. The play button flashes yellow-green as you do, brighter the louder it is.</p><p>For headphones, plug a wired pair into the headphone socket. The speaker switches off while they’re plugged in, and taking them out while a story is playing pauses it.</p>",
        "link_text": "Can’t hear anything?",
        "link_url": "/pages/quick-fixes#light-green"
      }
    },
    "bedtime": {
      "type": "help-topic",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "bedtime",
        "heading": "Bedtime mode",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/bedtime-mode-visuals.png",
        "tinted": true,
        "content": "<p>Bedtime mode plays the story for 20 minutes, then pauses on its own.</p>",
        "steps_heading": "Switch it on or off",
        "steps": "Press both arrow buttons together until you hear a tone.\nThe play button turns orange while bedtime mode is on.\nDo the same again to switch it off, and the play button goes back to blue. Switching the player off also ends bedtime mode."
      }
    },
    "travel": {
      "type": "help-topic",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "travel",
        "heading": "Travel mode",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/v2-controls-travel_mode.png",
        "image_position": "start",
        "content": "<p>Travel mode locks the buttons, so the player doesn’t switch on in a bag or skip chapters on the way.</p>",
        "steps_heading": "Switch it on or off",
        "steps": "Hold − and + together for a second, until you hear a tone.\nThe play button glows pink for a few seconds, then goes dark. While travel mode is on, pressing a button just shows the pink light again.\nTo unlock, hold − and + together again until the play button turns blue.",
        "link_text": "Player looks dead? Check travel mode",
        "link_url": "/pages/quick-fixes#light-pink"
      }
    },
